    "recommendations": "Addressing the single access point and extended driveway could meaningfully improve emergency response effectiveness at this property. Ensuring the driveway remains wide enough to allow simultaneous ingress and egress for emergency vehicles would support continuous operations during multi-unit responses. Displaying a clearly visible address marker at the street frontage could assist responding units in locating the property quickly, particularly given the limited visibility along the access corridor. Keeping the driveway and pedestrian walkways clear of obstructions would support responder movement between the main building and detached structure. Providing a designated staging area near the access point may assist personnel during extended operations."
